From c7d1dc3c9c8ffa2378e12aa61d2984311f63a7fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 12 May 2026 21:51:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix row filtering, remove auto-scroll, handle binary payloads
 faithfully
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Filtering bug: isExternalFilterPresent always returning true caused AG Grid
to run doesExternalFilterPass during applyTransaction before checkedSubjectsRef
was populated, filtering every row. Fix: drop external filter entirely; restore
visibleMessages (useMemo) in App and pass the pre-filtered array to MessageGrid.
applyTransaction is kept for pure appends, detected via O(1) object-identity
check on the tail item — structural changes (subject toggle, clear, tab switch)
fall back to a full setGridOption rowData reset.

Auto-scroll: removed ensureIndexVisible; grid stays at current scroll position
as new messages arrive.

Binary payloads: server now does a UTF-8 round-trip check (Buffer → utf8 string →
back to Buffer → equals) and sends encoding: 'text' | 'base64'. DetailPanel
shows a 'binary · base64' badge and renders the base64 string verbatim for
binary messages; JSON badge and pretty-print for valid JSON text.

https://claude.ai/code/session_01AkrmDxxeHDSgFUecYSnsXa
